              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kiner Yonatan nuejok nuka Daudi mama ejai Saul papake, kotema ŋes atiar, “Kinyek ekabaka adiakar kama ejai ekejaanakinanike Daudi; naarai mam ŋes ediakarit kamakon, akeswamisio da kamakon araas nukajokak noi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
