              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 27:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naarai abu kijaik akeiiar akanike, kocam Epilisitiat, kiswama EJAKAIT aipikor naepol kanuka Isirael kere; ibu ijo da koany, kiyalamikin: kanukinyo do idiakaria ijo kama ejaas aokot numam akirot, aiar Daudi komam akirot?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kopup Saul eporoto loka Yonatan: kiyapo Saul ebe, “Kwape ejaria EJAKAIT, mam ŋes eario.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konyarau Yonatan Daudi, kitejen ŋes akiro nun kere. Koyanau Yonatan Daudi mama ejai Saul, kojaenena do akonyeneke kwape lem sek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
