        },
        {
          "text": " Koker Daudi, koku, kobu mama ejai Samuel Rama kolimok ŋes kere nuabu Saul kiswamak ŋes. Koloto ŋesi ka Samuel aiboi Naiot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
